/* P028: Assembly OCAF document contains non-shape labels with null topological shape: Joints, Variables, Constraints, Configurations, LinkGroup labels all have null shapes; STEP writer color-attribution pass dereferences null shape during traversal and crashes; resulting STEP file is truncated mid-write (truncated output); Empty/null shape entries in PRODUCT_DEFINITION chain; kernel must skip non-shape labels with a warning before traversal; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
